1
00:00:00,161 --> 00:00:01,491
(Leonard:)Not really.

2
00:00:01,496 --> 00:00:04,696
(Penny:)But you're curious
about aluminum cans.

3
00:00:05,699 --> 00:00:07,939
(Penny:)You're a weird
little guy.

4
00:00:10,704 --> 00:00:13,674
(Sheldon:)That's it. The Sheldon Cooper
Girlfriend Challenge

5
00:00:13,675 --> 00:00:16,145
(Sheldon:)is officially live.
(chuckles)

6
00:00:16,144 --> 00:00:17,874
(Howard:)Congratulations.
This is exciting.

7
00:00:17,879 --> 00:00:19,049
(Sheldon:)Right now,

8
00:00:19,047 --> 00:00:21,247
(Sheldon:)somewhere, a woman
is dividing the atomic weight

9
00:00:21,249 --> 00:00:23,779
(Sheldon:)of the best noble gas
by the number of colors

10
00:00:23,785 --> 00:00:26,785
(Sheldon:)in the oldest national flag still in use...
Then using

11
00:00:26,788 --> 00:00:29,188
(Howard:)that number as the average speed
to calculate the travel time

12
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:31,190
(Howard:)from Mordor to the Shire.
And...

13
00:00:31,192 --> 00:00:33,492
(Sheldon:)taking her first step
towards a lifetime

14
00:00:33,495 --> 00:00:37,265
(Sheldon:)of laughter,
love and, best of all, rules.

15
00:00:37,265 --> 00:00:40,295
I-I hope we didn't make
the puzzles too hard.

16
00:00:40,292 --> 00:00:43,602
(Howard:)Well... if she can solve them,
it'll prove she's intelligent,

17
00:00:43,605 --> 00:00:45,405
(Howard:)tenacious and...
so socially awkward

18
00:00:45,407 --> 00:00:48,077
(Howard:)she has nothing better to do
on a Saturday night.

19
00:00:49,843 --> 00:00:52,743
(Sheldon:)Golly, she sounds
too good to be true.

20
00:00:55,149 --> 00:00:57,079
(Tall British Dave:)This is fun.
I haven't dated much

21
00:00:57,085 --> 00:00:58,815
(Tall British Dave:)since my divorce.

22
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:00,890
(Amy:)Well, I'm having
a good time, too.

